    "title": "Three in running for county clerk seat - NewsBreak",
    "text": "10 hours ago The Jefferson County Clerk seat has a three-way race within the Republican Party. Steve Wyatt Earp, Jaclyn Riebold and Brent Myers are running on the Republican ballot. Republican Jeannie Goff, who has served mainly as the second-in-command in the office for 35 years under five county clerks, opted not to run again after being elected as County Clerk in 2022. Read full article",
